        {
          "es": "Dos dioses peleaban por saber quién era el más grande.",
          "en": "Two gods were fighting over who was the greatest."
        },
        {
          "es": "Brahma dijo: «Yo hice todo. Levántate y salúdame».",
          "en": "Brahma said, “I made everything. Stand up and greet me.”"
        },
        {
          "es": "Vishnu sonrió: «Naciste de mi ombligo, hijo mío».",
          "en": "Vishnu smiled. “You were born from my navel, my son.”"
        },
        {
          "es": "El Shiva Purana, un libro dedicado a Shiva, lo cuenta así.",
          "en": "The Shiva Purana, a book devoted to Shiva, tells it this way."
        }
