          "en": "It shone brighter than a thousand suns."
        },
        {
          "es": "Nadie podía ver dónde empezaba ni dónde terminaba.",
          "en": "No one could see where it began or where it ended."
        },
        {
          "es": "Quien encontrara su final sería el más grande.",
          "en": "Whoever found its end would be the greatest."
